{
  "_doc": "Registry of single owners. Each concept has exactly one owner (file + symbol). The gate fails if the owner symbol is missing, or if a pattern that re-implements the concept appears in any other file. Values that designers tune live in data tables (project/data); see CLAUDE.md > Definicoes.",
  "concepts": [
    {
      "id": "building_height",
      "owner": "native/src/sim/simulation/growth.cpp",
